   {
     "deployment": null,
     "provenance_status": "incomplete"
   }

   Assert that no deployment fields appear alongside the null deployment.

5. No external side effects

   For an incomplete candidate, verify that there is:
   - no deploy-event publication;
   - no customer-visible deploy card or timeline entry;
   - no notification;
   - no external cache or search-index write;
   - no downstream deploy workflow invocation.

